⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of I-330
node WE1 · WE1 · ⟦I-330:WE1:5337bf⟧

WHO   — I-330 — the rebel who infects him
WHAT  — The carrier of the ‘disease’: she shows D-503 the wild, the soul, and the world beyond the Wall.
WHERE — WE1 · WE  Framework inputs: We (Yevgeny Zamyatin, 1924)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because rebellion enters through a person who insists on being one — and pays for it on the Benefactor's machine.
HOW   — By forbidden cigarettes and drink, seduction, and the Mephi's plan to seize the Integral and breach the Wall.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I gave him a soul on purpose — and they tortured me to death while the man I woke watched, cured and calm, feeling nothing at all.

